## Other services the platform contacts

These services are not sub-processors. They receive only what is needed for the task
described, without the user's name.

| Service | What it receives | Why |
|---|---|---|
| {{ providers.maps.name }}, {{ providers.maps.country.en }} ({{ providers.maps.products.en }}) | The supply address, and the IP address of the browser that displays a map | Locating the supply address within the community's area; showing maps |
| The push service of the user's browser (for example, Google, Mozilla or Apple) | An encrypted notification, which the push service cannot read | Delivering push notifications the user has allowed |

## Changes

